{"Title":"An Act exempting all uniformed positions in the police department of the town of East Bridgewater from the civil service law","BillNumber":"H3871","DocketNumber":"HD1291","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AMS2","Name":"Alyson M. Sullivan-Almeida","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMS2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T11:06:09.313"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AMS2","Name":"Alyson M. Sullivan-Almeida","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMS2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T11:06:09.3133333"},{"Id":"G_C2","Name":"Gerard J. Cassidy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/G_C2","ResponseDate":"2023-05-17T13:41:59.35"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3871/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Sullivan-Almeida of Abington, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 7B) of Alyson M. Sullivan-Almeida that the town of East Bridgewater be authorized to exempt uniformed positions within the police department of said town from the civil service law.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, all uniformed positions within the police department of the Town of East Bridgewater, including the positions of police deputy chief, police lieutenant, police sergeant, and police patrol officer shall be exempt from chapter 31 of the General Laws.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall not impair the civil service status of person holding a position described in Section 1 on the effective date of this act.\r\n\tSECTION 3: This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}